Z||000012||Dave Gunsul||07-11-2001||09:36 PM||||Interesting info 88 form. the cams are almost identical since the 260h makes more lowend power and the Crane makes more high.<BR>The acceleration times are the same.<P>Even though the hypers allow closer tolerances the forged offer more detonation<BR>resistance. By that I mean that if detonation occurs forged pistons are less likely to wind up with a hole than hypers are. If i remeber correctly forged pistons also run cooler.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
